## Keylogger Fundamentals

A keylogger records keystrokes. There are two primary architectural categories:

| Category | Description | Privilege Required |
|----------|-------------|-------------------|
| **Userland** | Intercepts keyboard input at the application or OS API level | Same as target user |
| **Kernel-mode** | Hooks the keyboard interrupt handler or filters device IRPs | Administrator/root |

